@VmlTest.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5065

### 1. Estado del servicio y de la base de datos -> 200 OK
GET {{VmlTest.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Registro de usuario -> 201 Created
POST {{VmlTest.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "candidato@vml.com",
  "password": "ClaveSegura123"
}

### 2b. Registro repetido -> 409 Conflict
POST {{VmlTest.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "candidato@vml.com",
  "password": "ClaveSegura123"
}

### 2c. Registro con datos inválidos -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{VmlTest.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sin-arroba",
  "password": "corta"
}

### 3. Login correcto -> 200 OK con token
POST {{VmlTest.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "candidato@vml.com",
  "password": "ClaveSegura123"
}

### 3b. Login con contraseña incorrecta -> 401 Unauthorized
POST {{VmlTest.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "candidato@vml.com",
  "password": "ClaveEquivocada123"
}
